{
  "_about": "#1478 pump kit PREPARATION, all DRAFT. Box list and draft rule cards for a centrifugal pump datasheet, built only from the standards the library already holds. Every card is a draft: no engineer has signed it off, no real pump document has proved it. Read only when `pump_kit_draft_enabled` is on (off by default). Rule text is in our own words, never the standard's. Cards whose value no held standard requires stay draft 'needs a standard we do not hold' (order 301.1).",
